# OpenAI API 配置模板

```json
{
  "name": "openai",
  "description": "OpenAI API 配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "api": "openai",
  "config": {
    "apiKey": "${OPENAI_API_KEY}",
    "apiUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1",
    "models": {
      "gpt-4": "gpt-4",
      "gpt-4-turbo": "gpt-4-turbo-preview",
      "gpt-3.5-turbo": "gpt-3.5-turbo",
      "dall-e-3": "dall-e-3",
      "dall-e-2": "dall-e-2",
      "whisper": "whisper-1",
      "tts-1": "tts-1",
      "tts-1-hd": "tts-1-hd",
      "embeddings-3": "text-embedding-3-small",
      "embeddings-3-large": "text-embedding-3-large"
    },
    "defaultModel": "gpt-4"
  },
  "features": [
    "文本生成",
    "图像生成",
    "语音识别",
    "语音合成",
    "嵌入向量"
  ],
  "pricing": {
    "gpt-4": {
      "input": 30,
      "output": 60
    },
    "gpt-4-turbo": {
      "input": 10,
      "output": 30
    },
    "gpt-3.5-turbo": {
      "input": 0.5,
      "output": 1.5
    },
    "dall-e-3": {
      "standard": 40,
      "hd": 80
    },
    "whisper": {
      "per_minute": 0.006
    }
  },
  "setup": {
    "getApiKey": "https://platform.openai.com/api-keys",
    "docs": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/"
  }
}
```

## 使用示例

```bash
# GPT-4 调用
curl -X POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $OPENAI_API_KEY" \
  -d '{
    "model": "gpt-4",
    "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "你好"}]
  }'
```

## 文件位置
`templates/ai-tools/openai-config.json`
